  "video_id": "VEPL_Sdxw-Y",
  "title": "10/10 ai skills making you intellectually dangerous",
  "description": "Follow me and DM me \"PISTACHIO\" on IG/FB only 👇\n\n10/10 AI skills making you intellectually dangerous. Learn these and you'll be smarter than 95% of people.\n\n1. Context. This is the information you give AI about your situation, so AI gives you relevant advice. Type, \"Ask me 5 clarifying questions,\" and this changes everything.\n\n2. Code Words. Simple words like \"ELI10\" or \"REDTEAM\" totally transform how AI talks to you. Once you understand YOU control AI, you'll stop falling for its lies.\n\n3. Projects. This means grouping your chats by similar topics, so AI remembers the purpose of each chat. Once you set this up, you'll save hours each week by not repeating yourself.\n\n4. Skills. When you do the same thing multiple times, turn it into a Skill. This helps you automate repetitive tasks, and you should improve the Skill every time you use it.\n\nWhat AI skills should beginners learn first?\nHow do I get better answers from ChatGPT?\nHow do ChatGPT Projects and Skills work?\n\n#ai #chatgpt #chatgptprompts #aitools #productivity",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-08T08:30:55Z",
  "channel_name": "Sabrina Ramonov 🍄",
  "transcript": "Follow me and DM me \"PISTACHIO\" on IG/FB only 👇\n\n10/10 AI skills making you intellectually dangerous. Learn these and you'll be smarter than 95% of people.\n\n1. Context. This is the information you give AI about your situation, so AI gives you relevant advice. Type, \"Ask me 5 clarifying questions,\" and this changes everything.\n\n2. Code Words. Simple words like \"ELI10\" or \"REDTEAM\" totally transform how AI talks to you. Once you understand YOU control AI, you'll stop falling for its lies.\n\n3. Projects. This means grouping your chats by similar topics, so AI remembers the purpose of each chat. Once you set this up, you'll save hours each week by not repeating yourself.\n\n4. Skills. When you do the same thing multiple times, turn it into a Skill. This helps you automate repetitive tasks, and you should improve the Skill every time you use it.\n\nWhat AI skills should beginners learn first?\nHow do I get better answers from ChatGPT?\nHow do ChatGPT Projects and Skills work?\n\n#ai #chatgpt #chatgptprompts #aitools #productivity",
